  <name>VitaHub</name>
  <summary>Plex, Audiobookshelf, Suwayomi and Music Assistant in one app</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      VitaHub brings four controller-friendly clients together in one app with
      one interface, built on borealis and libmpv.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Plex: movies, TV, music, photos, Live TV and DVR, downloads, SyncLounge</li>
      <li>Audiobookshelf: audiobooks and podcasts with progress sync and downloads</li>
      <li>Suwayomi: manga with paged and webtoon readers, tracking and extensions</li>
      <li>Music Assistant: local playback and control of your network players</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.breezyslasher.VitaHub.desktop</launchable>
